Route110_Text_H31::
	.string "THE BEST RECORD TO DATE…\p"
	.string "No. of collisions: {STR_VAR_1}\p"
	.string "Elapsed time: {STR_VAR_2}$"

@ BEGIN PATCH (tools/hoenn_import/patches)
Route110_Text_H0::
    .string "Which is it: straight up CYCLING\n"
    .string "ROAD to MAUVILLE, or the low road\l"
    .string "where the POKéMON are?\p"
    .string "I've been standing here deciding\n"
    .string "for an hour.$"

Route110_Text_H1::
    .string "The gate times runs now.\p"
    .string "No trick to it. Don't brake, don't\n"
    .string "stop, don't talk to anybody.$"

Route110_Text_H2::
    .string "No bicycle, so it's the low road\n"
    .string "for me.\p"
    .string "It's prettier down here anyway.$"

Route110_Text_H3::
    .string "That's one of RYDEL's frames.\p"
    .string "He puts his name on the down tube,\n"
    .string "the chain guard, the saddle, the\l"
    .string "pump, the bell and the box it came\l"
    .string "in.\p"
    .string "Ride it about. He'd like that.$"

Route110_Text_H4::
    .string "Two roads, one over the other.\p"
    .string "One for people in a hurry, one for\n"
    .string "everything that lives here.\p"
    .string "That seems about fair.$"

Route110_Text_H5::
    .string "My hair streams out behind me when\n"
    .string "I'm up to speed.\p"
    .string "That's what I grew it for. Not\n"
    .string "for standing still and explaining\l"
    .string "it.$"

Route110_Text_H6::
    .string "Full speed down CYCLING ROAD with\n"
    .string "nothing in the way.\p"
    .string "One day. When I'm tall enough for\n"
    .string "a frame.$"

Route110_Text_H7_0::
    .string "I haven't stopped pedalling since\n"
    .string "the north gate.\p"
    .string "My legs have gone solid.$"

Route110_Text_H7_1::
    .string "Cramp. I knew it.$"

Route110_Text_H7_2::
    .string "You've BADGES on you.\p"
    .string "That explains the last two\n"
    .string "minutes.$"

Route110_Text_H8_0::
    .string "Oi. Think you can hold my wheel?$"

Route110_Text_H8_1::
    .string "Off and over the side.$"

Route110_Text_H8_2::
    .string "Speed doesn't win a battle.\p"
    .string "I'll have to sit down and think\n"
    .string "about that one.$"

Route110_Text_H9_0::
    .string "The triathlon is swim, ride, run,\n"
    .string "in that order, with no sitting\l"
    .string "down in between.$"

Route110_Text_H9_1::
    .string "Battles are no easier.$"

Route110_Text_H9_2::
    .string "I'm done in. A proper rest is part\n"
    .string "of the training, whatever they\l"
    .string "tell you.$"

Route110_Text_H10_0::
    .string "Fast is fine. Panicking is what\n"
    .string "puts you over the rail.$"

Route110_Text_H10_1::
    .string "And I panicked. In a battle.$"

Route110_Text_H10_2::
    .string "No need to rush anything.\p"
    .string "The road's still there tomorrow.$"

Route110_Text_H11_0::
    .string "I have seen what you mean to do.\p"
    .string "Therefore I cannot lose.$"

Route110_Text_H11_1::
    .string "I did not see that.$"

Route110_Text_H11_2::
    .string "I see your road ahead…\p"
    .string "Hmm. A light. A very bright light\n"
    .string "and a great deal of noise.\p"
    .string "MAUVILLE, probably.$"

Route110_Text_H12_0::
    .string "Ahahaha!\n"
    .string "Prepare to be astounded!$"

Route110_Text_H12_1::
    .string "Astoundingly beaten.$"

Route110_Text_H12_2::
    .string "You won by a wonder. A fluke.\p"
    .string "Don't expect wonders twice.$"

Route110_Text_H13_0::
    .string "Could I see yours? One look.\n"
    .string "I won't touch.$"

Route110_Text_H13_1::
    .string "And my collection stays\n"
    .string "incomplete.$"

Route110_Text_H13_2::
    .string "One POKéMON I've never seen and\n"
    .string "I'm off after it for a week.$"

Route110_Text_H14_0::
    .string "Don't come up behind a man with a\n"
    .string "rod in his hands!$"

Route110_Text_H14_1::
    .string "Lost. Of course.$"

Route110_Text_H14_2::
    .string "Fishing is all concentration.\p"
    .string "You watch the float and nothing\n"
    .string "else. Like now. Go away.$"

Route110_Text_H15::
    .string "However it went, come back and try\n"
    .string "it again.\p"
    .string "The clock doesn't remember you.$"

Route110_Text_H16_0::
    .string "Whoa! Mind the line! You've not\n"
    .string "raced on this deck before.$"

Route110_Text_H16_1::
    .string "Whoa!\n"
    .string "My brakes!$"

Route110_Text_H16_2::
    .string "Soft tyres and tired brakes put\n"
    .string "people in the CENTRE.\p"
    .string "Check the bike before the gate,\n"
    .string "not after.$"

Route110_Text_H17_0::
    .string "I found some good ones in the\n"
    .string "grass down here!$"

Route110_Text_H17_1::
    .string "Good isn't the same as ready.$"

Route110_Text_H17_2::
    .string "A POKéMON caught this morning\n"
    .string "doesn't fight for you this\l"
    .string "afternoon.$"

Route110_Text_H18_0::
    .string "Ahahaha! I'll show these two off\n"
    .string "anywhere, to anyone.$"

Route110_Text_H18_1::
    .string "Oh dear. That won't do at all.$"

Route110_Text_H18_2::
    .string "Perhaps less battling and more\n"
    .string "showing off.\p"
    .string "There's a FAN CLUB in SLATEPORT\n"
    .string "for exactly that.$"

Route110_Text_H19_0::
    .string "Two small POKéMON helping each\n"
    .string "other. There is no better sight\l"
    .string "and I won't be argued with.$"

Route110_Text_H19_1::
    .string "Have you no feelings at all?$"

Route110_Text_H19_2::
    .string "All right, all right. You both did\n"
    .string "your best, my dears.$"

Route110_Text_H20_0::
    .string "I came off the upper deck.\p"
    .string "I intend to recover my dignity\n"
    .string "by beating you.$"

Route110_Text_H20_1::
    .string "Oh. That went badly too.$"

Route110_Text_H20_2::
    .string "Fell off the road, lost a battle.\p"
    .string "I'm going home by the low road\n"
    .string "where nobody can see me.$"

Route110_Text_H21_0::
    .string "Right! Full throttle! Keep up or\n"
    .string "get left behind!$"

Route110_Text_H21_1::
    .string "You kept up. Fair enough.$"

Route110_Text_H21_2::
    .string "This won't hold me down.\p"
    .string "A man learns more losing than he\n"
    .string "does winning. I've learned a lot\l"
    .string "this year.$"

Route110_Text_H22::
    .string "Someone painted “TEAM AQUA WAS\n"
    .string "HERE” on this sign.\p"
    .string "Someone else painted over it with\n"
    .string "“TEAM MAGMA RULES”.\p"
    .string "Underneath both, small and neat:\n"
    .string "“SOME OF US LIVE HERE.”$"

Route110_Text_H23::
    .string "SEASIDE PARKING\p"
    .string "“Bicycles only. The gate staff\n"
    .string "will move anything else.”$"

Route110_Text_H24::
    .string "SEASIDE CYCLING ROAD\p"
    .string "“Upper deck, bicycles. Lower road,\n"
    .string "everything else.”$"

Route110_Text_H25::
    .string "ROUTE 110\n"
    .string "{DOWN_ARROW} SLATEPORT CITY$"

Route110_Text_H26::
    .string "ROUTE 110\n"
    .string "{LEFT_ARROW} ROUTE 103\p"
    .string "NOTICE: the west path is closed\n"
    .string "while the bridge is replaced.$"

Route110_Text_H27::
    .string "ROUTE 110\n"
    .string "{UP_ARROW} MAUVILLE CITY$"

Route110_Text_H28::
    .string "TRAINER TIPS\p"
    .string "A sleeping or paralysed POKéMON\n"
    .string "cannot do much to you.\p"
    .string "Neither can a fainted one, but\n"
    .string "that takes longer.$"

Route110_Text_H29::
    .string "TRAINER TIPS\p"
    .string "Press SELECT in the BAG to move an\n"
    .string "item up the list.$"

Route110_Text_H30::
    .string "“Three steps {RIGHT_ARROW} and two steps {UP_ARROW}\n"
    .string "and knock on nothing at all.”\p"
    .string "Signed: THE TRICK MASTER.$"

Route110_Text_H32::
    .string "SEASIDE CYCLING ROAD\p"
    .string "“The clock starts at the north\n"
    .string "gate.”$"
Route110_Text_BoardRecord::
    .string "THE ROADSIDE BOARD\p"
    .string "Best run: {STR_VAR_1} seconds.\p"
    .string "Written up in chalk and rubbed out\n"
    .string "every time somebody beats it.$"

Route110_Text_BoardEmpty::
    .string "THE ROADSIDE BOARD\p"
    .string "Nothing chalked on it yet.\p"
    .string "The gate staff start the clock at\n"
    .string "the north end.$"
@ END PATCH
